                  "description": "Identify cap_rate, sizing_rate (or sizing_rate_increment), egi (or egi_multiplier) as Sheet!A1 addresses. Alternatively provide egi_gross_potential_rent and egi_other_income, which can both be scaled with loss percentage held constant."
